-- Showcase Level 1 (design sum-type-showcase): projecting out of a neural
-- Either. `fromLeft` is total (task maybe-partial-functions): it returns
-- `Just x = right x` on a Left and `Nothing = left ()` on a Right, so the
-- Right branch of the network shows up as the whole mass of `Left ()`.
neural eitherNN :: (Symbol -> Either Int Bool) of ([0, 1, 2] | [True, False])
main sym = fromLeft (eitherNN sym)
